## Data architecture

Biological sample files have one authoritative copy under `data/datasets/`. Metadata lives in `data/catalog/`; reusable teaching models live in `data/knowledge/`; migration hashes live in `data/provenance/`. Run `npm run data:materialize` to generate browser-delivery files under `public/data/`. See `docs/DATA_ARCHITECTURE_V4.md`.
